sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as 开发者
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant Build as build job
    participant Gate as deploy gates (dry-run)
    participant Wrangler as wrangler CLI
    participant Pages as Cloudflare Pages

    Dev->>GH: git push main (或 open PR)
    alt 事件 = push main (生产部署)
        GH->>Build: checkout + pnpm install (锁定包管理器)
        Build->>Build: format:check / lint / typecheck / test / docs:check
        Build->>Build: pnpm --filter @wnr/web build (next build → out/)
        Build->>Gate: build-immutable-artifact (计算 artifactId)
        Gate->>Gate: deploy-preview / verify-preview-repositories / preview-smoke / promotion-dry-run
        Note over Gate: dry-run，绝不调用 Cloudflare API
        Gate->>Gate: secret-scan (构建产物无密钥泄漏)
        Note over Gate: D1 migrate = 休眠（本期无绑定，不执行）
        GH->>Wrangler: wrangler pages deploy out --project-name where-not-rain
        Wrangler->>Pages: 上传静态产物（复用同一 out/）
        Pages-->>GH: 生产部署完成
    else 事件 = PR (预览部署)
        GH->>Build: 同上 build + gates
        GH->>Wrangler: wrangler pages deploy out --branch <pr> --project-name where-not-rain
        Wrangler->>Pages: 上传预览产物
        Pages-->>GH: 预览 URL
    end
